{"id":"772657e2b19db9ce","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-random-coin-machine.md","title":"逐步公平掷币的多带图灵机","display":"df-random-coin-machine — 逐步公平掷币的多带图灵机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-random-coin-machine","aliases":["73-df-random-coin-machine"],"display":"df-random-coin-machine — 逐步公平掷币的多带图灵机","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.2, print pp. 503–504; PDF pp. 525–526; local fresh-coin simulation of the random-tape model","source_status":"source-model-checked; explicit local model; polynomial simulation explained","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-random-coin-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-random-coin-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random-coin-machine — 逐步公平掷币的多带图灵机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.2, print pp. 503–504; PDF pp. 525–526; local fresh-coin simulation of the random-tape model"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-model-checked; explicit local model; polynomial simulation explained"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选二元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MConf}\">\\(\\operatorname{MConf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathsf{in}}\">\\(C^{\\mathsf{in}}\\)</span> 和一步关系采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a>。有效实例中写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_0,M_1)\">\\(M=(M_0,M_1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbf2\">\\(b\\in\\mathbf2\\)</span>，配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 取二者共同的配置域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M_0,M_1\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma(T)\\}\\;\\bigl[M=(M_0,M_1)\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,2,3,4,5,7,8,9\\}\\;\\pi_j(M_0)=\\pi_j(M_1)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M_0,M_1\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma(T)\\}\\;\\bigl[M=(M_0,M_1)\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,2,3,4,5,7,8,9\\}\\;\\pi_j(M_0)=\\pi_j(M_1)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{MConf}_{M_0},\\qquad\nC_M^0(w)\\coloneqq C_{M_0}^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),\\qquad\nC\\xrightarrow{b}_MD\\Longleftrightarrow C\\to_{M_b}D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{MConf}_{M_0},\\qquad\nC_M^0(w)\\coloneqq C_{M_0}^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),\\qquad\nC\\xrightarrow{b}_MD\\Longleftrightarrow C\\to_{M_b}D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两台确定机仅在第 6 分量转移函数上可不同；每一步用一个新的公平比特选择转移，相同转移可忽略该比特。该本地模型模拟第三版随机带：第一次访问某格时掷币并记录，以后重访读取同一记录；反向用随机带上的新格供每步选择。存储与查询记录有多项式开销，故保持 RP 的最坏多项式界。对 ZPP 不能直接把逐路径的多项式开销作用于期望：有限的一阶矩不保证高阶矩有限。应先把期望多项式零错误机截断为 L 与补语言的两个 RP 检验，进行有界模拟，再用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0afef8eeccddc023\" href=\"?note=0afef8eeccddc023\" title=\"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection\">73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection</a> 的独立重试恢复期望多项式零错误机。反向从新比特模型到随机带可逐步常数开销模拟。它不是声称教材曾给出这个二元组。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$M$ 为候选二元组。$\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{MConf}$、$C^{\\mathsf{in}}$ 和一步关系采用 [[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]。有效实例中写 $M=(M_0,M_1)$；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$b\\in\\mathbf2$，配置 $C,D$ 取二者共同的配置域。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"两台确定机仅在第 6 分量转移函数上可不同；每一步用一个新的公平比特选择转移，相同转移可忽略该比特。该本地模型模拟第三版随机带：第一次访问某格时掷币并记录，以后重访读取同一记录；反向用随机带上的新格供每步选择。存储与查询记录有多项式开销，故保持 RP 的最坏多项式界。对 ZPP 不能直接把逐路径的多项式开销作用于期望：有限的一阶矩不保证高阶矩有限。应先把期望多项式零错误机截断为 L 与补语言的两个 RP 检验，进行有界模拟，再用 [[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]] 的独立重试恢复期望多项式零错误机。反向从新比特模型到随机带可逐步常数开销模拟。它不是声称教材曾给出这个二元组。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MConf}","display":false},{"tex":"C^{\\mathsf{in}}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_0,M_1)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"C,D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M_0,M_1\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_\\Sigma(T)\\}\\;\\bigl[M=(M_0,M_1)\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,2,3,4,5,7,8,9\\}\\;\\pi_j(M_0)=\\pi_j(M_1)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RConf}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{MConf}_{M_0},\\qquad\nC_M^0(w)\\coloneqq C_{M_0}^{\\mathsf{in}}(w),\\qquad\nC\\xrightarrow{b}_MD\\Longleftrightarrow C\\to_{M_b}D.","display":true}],"bytes":2298,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-coin-machine]]"},{"id":"268198a54d09f8b1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-coin-machine|逐步公平掷币的多带图灵机]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["9fa7db79fea5f29a","0afef8eeccddc023"]}